      "text": "DNS for beta.leocdp.com -> the load balancer, and Caddy's Let's Encrypt cert issued.  (api falls back to SSO_LOGIN=false until sso-realm runs \u2014 safe to run early, re-run after.)",
      "originalText": "DNS for beta.leocdp.com -> the load balancer, and Caddy's Let's Encrypt cert issued.  (api falls back to SSO_LOGIN=false until sso-realm runs \u2014 safe to run early, re-run after.)",
